"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[33,21,68,66,51,37],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[33,21,68,66,51,37],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1000115","city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[33,21,68,66,51,37],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1028","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[33,21,68,66,51,37],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10127","city":"CS1016","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[33,21,68,66,51,37],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1027105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国官臣，官至尚书，丁谧与曹爽部下何晏、邓飏三人被外人合称“台中三狗”。丁谧曾因无礼而被曹叡下令逮捕，但因丁谧为功臣丁斐之子，只好免刑作罢。后经常与何晏谗言曹爽，使司马懿权力被架空，司马懿发动政变后，丁谧与曹爽众党羽被捕，同被诛三族。","tc":"魏國官臣，官至尚書，丁謐與曹爽部下何晏、鄧飏三人被外人合稱“臺中三狗”。丁謐曾因無禮而被曹叡下令逮捕，但因丁謐為功臣丁斐之子，只好免刑作罷。后經常與何晏讒言曹爽，使司馬懿權力被架空，司馬懿發動政變后，丁謐與曹爽眾黨羽被捕，同被誅三族。","en":"An official of Wei who reached the rank of Imperial Secretary. Along with He Yan and Deng Yang, both subordinates of Cao Shuang, Ding Mi was mockingly called one of the ‘Three Dogs of the Secretariat’ by outsiders. He was once arrested on Cao Rui's orders for disrespectful behavior, but was released because he was the son of the meritorious Ding Fei. He frequently whispered slander to Cao Shuang alongside He Yan, systematically undermining Sima Yi's authority. After Sima Yi's coup, Ding Mi was captured along with Cao Shuang's entire faction and his clan was exterminated to the third degree.","jp":"魏の臣。官位は尚書に至る。丁謐は曹爽配下の何晏、鄧颺と共に世間から「台中の三狗」と称された。かつて無礼を理由に曹叡から逮捕を命じられたが、功臣である丁斐の子であったため処罰を免れた。後に何晏と共に曹爽へ讒言を重ねて司馬懿の権力を骨抜きにした。司馬懿が政変を起こすと、丁謐は曹爽一党と共に捕縛され、三族誅殺となった。","kr":"위나라의 신하로, 관직은 상서에 이르렀다. 정밀은 조상의 심복인 하안, 등양과 함께 세간에서 '대중삼구(대중의 세 마리 개)'라 불렸다. 일찍이 무례한 처신으로 조예가 체포를 명하기도 했으나, 공신 정비의 아들이었기에 처벌을 면하고 불문에 부쳐졌다. 이후 하안과 함께 조상에게 자주 참언하여 사마의의 권력을 무력화시켰으나, 사마의가 정변을 일으킨 뒤 조상의 여러 당여와 함께 체포되어 삼족이 멸해졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10858","remark":"","surname":"丁","surnameTc":"丁","surnameEn":"Ding","surnameJp":"丁","surnameKr":"정","surnameOther":"","name":"谧","nameTc":"謐","nameEn":"Mi","nameJp":"謐","nameKr":"밀","nameOther":"","word":"彦靖","wordTc":"彥靖","wordEn":"Yanjing","wordJp":"彦靖","wordKr":"언정","wordOther":"","icon":"丁谧","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"245","city":"CS1028","gender":"0","rule":"33","force":"21","wise":"68","politics":"66","charm":"51","will":"37","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"6","willTalent"